00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:43.410
You're kicking us out of our clubhouse?

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:44.820
But why?

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:47.950
You can't just tell us to leave suddenly. I won't go along with it.

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:51.460
We won't stand for the abuse of the student government!

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:55.170
The thing is,

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:59.550
the Jersey Club is not a formal, school-authorized club.

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:00.670
What?

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:06.550
You all know that, right?

00:04:06.550 --> 00:04:07.260
Huh?

00:04:07.260 --> 00:04:09.100
Is this true, Madoka?

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:13.230
Oh!

00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:15.650
We might not be an official club!

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:16.810
I'm glad you understand...

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:19.480
Maybe we're not a club, but a group?

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:23.570
There, there.

00:04:23.570 --> 00:04:25.530
You have it rough.

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:26.910
