00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:27.910
Huh?

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:32.080
Common sense says

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:36.000
the school would never approve the Jersey Club's activities.

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:37.420
If they did,

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:40.250
that'd be like one of the "Seven Wonders" of the school.

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:42.260
But even so...

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:45.720
But we've been the Jersey Club

00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:47.890
ever since our big sis Youko started it!

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:51.390
The school never had any complaints.

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:56.650
Until now, they kept things under the rug and let things slide.

00:04:57.560 --> 00:05:00.070
This school's too laid back.

00:05:02.480 --> 00:05:05.280
I'm sorry it turned out like this.

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:06.410
That's okay.

00:05:06.410 --> 00:05:08.280
It's not your fault, Shoko.

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:10.030
Besides, even without a clubhouse,

00:05:10.030 --> 00:05:11.700
we're still the Jersey Club.

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:15.710
But I'm going to miss our clubhouse.

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:16.830
I know.

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:20.790
