00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:25.260
Hey, I just had a good idea!

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:30.640
We'll get the Jersey Club formally approved!

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:31.760
Oh...

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:34.140
