It's about the Jersey Club clubhouse you showed me.

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:11.580
Oh, you mean that storeroom?

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:15.130
The Student Council wants them to vacate it.

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:16.000
Oh.

00:12:16.170 --> 00:12:19.090
So to keep that room,

00:12:19.090 --> 00:12:21.630
Madoka is trying to make the Jersey Club an official school club.

00:12:23.720 --> 00:12:25.840
Is that even possible?

00:12:34.390 --> 00:12:35.730
Thank you very much.

00:12:36.810 --> 00:12:40.440
Should you be ignoring that boy over there?

00:12:39.730 --> 00:12:42.570
Youko! You know I...

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:42.570
Just ignore him.

00:12:43.110 --> 00:12:44.400
He's not a kid.

00:12:44.400 --> 00:12:48.330
Man, I really drink too much when I'm with you.

00:12:48.330 --> 00:12:49.490
Machiko...

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:53.500
Did you call me out just to update me about the Jersey Club?

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:55.920
That's not the real reason, is it?

00:12:57.000 --> 00:12:58.340
You saw right through me.

00:12:58.790 --> 00:13:00.130
Then I'll just come out and say it.

00:13:02.420 --> 00:13:04.630
Isn't it about time you free yourself?

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:05.720
Free myself?

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:07.970
You originally formed the Jersey Club

00:13:07.970 --> 00:13:11.640
to cheer up Madoka who just lost her mother.

00:13:11.890 --> 00:13:14.230
But I think,

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:20.020
the one who really needed the Jersey Club was you, Youko.

00:13:23.990 --> 00:13:27.200
You admired Madoka's mother.

00:13:29.240 --> 00:13:32.540
But what Madoka is trying to protect right now,

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:34.540
isn't the Jersey Club from the past.

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:38.250
So?

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:42.000
She's not the little Madoka we used to know anymore.

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:46.680
But when I look at you,

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:51.180
I get the sense that you're still bound to the Jersey Club from the past.

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:53.850
It hurts me to see you like this—

00:13:53.850 --> 00:13:54.720
Stop right there.

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:57.810
This is why I don't like teachers.

00:13:58.310 --> 00:14:00.190
Why do teachers like to make assumptions about people's feelings?

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:01.400
Is it an occupational side effect?

00:14:03.650 --> 00:14:04.690
I'm sorry.

00:14:04.690 --> 00:14:06.240
That was a slip.

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:08.780
It's just the alcohol talking. Forget I ever said it.

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:11.530
I had fun tonight.

00:14:11.530 --> 00:14:13.290
I should get going.

00:14:21.630 --> 00:14:24.300
Today, we're helping the Chorus Club.

00:14:27.550 --> 00:14:29.630
May I ask a question?

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:31.340
Sure. What is it?

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:35.470
When will I be able to pilot a robot?

00:14:35.470 --> 00:14:36.640
Robot?

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:41.810
Isn't piloting robots and protecting Kamogawa what the Jersey Club does?

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:42.520
Huh?

00:14:43.020 --> 00:14:47.150
I saw you fight in a robot once.

00:14:47.150 --> 00:14:50.740
That's when I decided I was going to pilot a robot and protect Kamogawa too.

00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:57.290
Thank you very much.

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:07.920
I think we should clear up the misunderstanding with Reiko.

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:10.880
But she just joined our club.

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:14.430
Without Reiko, we'll lose our clubhouse.

00:15:14.430 --> 00:15:16.560
That's true, but...

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:18.730
I've made a decision!

