00:15:28.740 --> 00:15:30.990
Okay. The link is good.

00:15:31.610 --> 00:15:34.530
Starting the broadcast to Polyhedron.

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:41.710
Wow! That's beautiful!

00:15:42.370 --> 00:15:43.540
Miss Kyono.

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:46.210
Thanks for coming, Reiko!

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:49.460
Why are we here at the Tanada Night Festival?

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:51.010
Jersey Club work.

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:53.930
Kirius, are you ready?

00:15:54.220 --> 00:15:56.350
Of course. Everything is perfect.

00:15:56.970 --> 00:15:58.560
Watch, Reiko!

00:16:12.030 --> 00:16:13.320
Awesome!

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:16.700
You know what Reiko?

00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:17.620
Yes?

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:22.250
What we do in the Jersey Club is a little different than what you think.

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:22.870
Huh?

00:16:23.710 --> 00:16:25.920
We don't just pilot robots.

00:16:25.920 --> 00:16:28.380
We rode in the Vox and fought in order to protect everyone's—

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:31.010
no, <i>our</i> happiness.

00:16:31.210 --> 00:16:33.430
But that's over now.

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:37.430
We'll never, ever be using the Vox for fighting again.

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:39.970
That need is gone.

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:41.640
The fighting has ended.

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:42.770
But...

00:16:44.850 --> 00:16:46.730
I'm sorry to disappoint you.

00:16:47.810 --> 00:16:53.450
But we still want you to be one of us in the Jersey Club.

00:16:54.820 --> 00:16:56.320
Mommy, did you know?

00:16:56.740 --> 00:16:58.740
That one's called Aura!

00:16:58.740 --> 00:17:00.120
It's lovely.

00:17:00.990 --> 00:17:02.250
Wow, look!

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:05.670
That's so cool!

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:15.970
Array! The balloon!

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:17.300
I'm on it!

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:23.850
Success!

00:17:27.350 --> 00:17:27.980
Huh?

00:17:29.940 --> 00:17:30.770
Madoka!

00:17:30.770 --> 00:17:31.440
Madoka!

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:37.570
This isn't how it was supposed to go...

00:17:37.570 --> 00:17:38.950
Miss Kyono!

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:42.870
Reiko!

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:45.870
How do I look?

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:48.330
Everybody, how do I look?

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:49.250
Huh?

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:53.300
What we do in the Jersey Club everyday,

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:56.800
we do for everybody's happiness!

00:17:57.010 --> 00:17:58.260
Madoka.

00:17:58.260 --> 00:18:00.260
What in the world are you doing?

00:18:00.260 --> 00:18:03.810
Mr. Tadokoro? Madoka's in big trouble!

00:18:04.270 --> 00:18:06.640
I'm so happy!

00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:08.600
There's Lan and Muginami,

00:18:08.940 --> 00:18:10.860
and now you too, Reiko!

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:13.610
But I want even more happiness!

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:15.240
That's why, Reiko,

00:18:15.240 --> 00:18:17.070
I want you to find what makes you happy!

00:18:17.570 --> 00:18:22.450
Then I'll do all I can to support you!

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:27.790
What makes me happy?

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:35.710
Happy, huh?

00:18:36.880 --> 00:18:39.380
Umm, somebody!

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:43.970
Do you know how to bring this down?

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:48.270
I'm sorry!

