00:18:49.600 --> 00:18:50.850
Reiko.

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:54.610
After watching you last night, I made up my mind.

00:18:54.860 --> 00:18:56.780
Made up your mind? About what?

00:18:56.780 --> 00:19:00.780
I'm going to look for what makes me happy.

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:04.120
I've decided to start a robot club.

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:05.370
A robot club?

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:06.200
Yes!

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:09.290
That way, one day, I'll ride in a robot like Aura!

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:13.000
You made me realize that, Miss Kyono.

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:14.500
Thank you so much!

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:16.670
O-Okay.

00:19:17.130 --> 00:19:18.420
Dropping out {SIGN}

00:19:18.590 --> 00:19:21.970
Oh man! I got all excited for nothing.

00:19:22.640 --> 00:19:23.760
Guess that's how it goes.

00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:26.470
Farewell, clubhouse!

00:19:26.970 --> 00:19:28.220
You know, Madoka.

00:19:28.220 --> 00:19:28.930
What?

00:19:29.140 --> 00:19:30.350
In that case, why don't we expand

00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:33.310
the Kamo Girls Jersey Club all across the universe?

00:19:33.310 --> 00:19:35.360
Hey! Great idea!

00:19:35.360 --> 00:19:38.150
We'll expand way beyond the clubhouse. The Kamogawa Jersey Club, Space Branch.

00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:39.900
Sounds like fun.

00:19:39.900 --> 00:19:42.530
The royal family of Le Garite will lend its full support.

00:19:42.860 --> 00:19:43.820
Really?!

00:19:43.820 --> 00:19:45.490
De Metrio too!

00:19:45.990 --> 00:19:48.240
Okay! Now that that's set,

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:49.160
We had another meeting after that one.

00:19:48.240 --> 00:19:50.790
let's get our Space Branch started!

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:50.790
The reassignment will be postponed,

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:53.080
Kamogawa Jersey Club, Space Branch!

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:55.500
As I was saying, so you can keep on using this room.

00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:55.500
Fight! Ohh!

00:19:56.250 --> 00:19:57.170
Fight! Ohh!

00:19:57.500 --> 00:19:59.090
Fight! Ohh!

00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:05.470
About the newly discovered stone slab...

00:20:06.430 --> 00:20:12.190
It might possibly describe the craft that caused the tragedy 20,000 years ago.

00:20:12.190 --> 00:20:13.690
Why do you think that?

00:20:14.190 --> 00:20:15.900
It's been bothering me all this time.

00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:20.400
The cause of the tragedy 20,000 years ago was due to a single craft,

00:20:20.400 --> 00:20:22.860
so why does the legend tell of three crafts?

00:20:22.860 --> 00:20:28.370
Most importantly, a tragedy definitely occurred, so why does the Earth show no signs?

00:20:29.740 --> 00:20:31.580
I just can't recall what happened

00:20:32.120 --> 00:20:34.080
after my soul was torn apart,

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:36.750
and absorbed into the Rin-ne.

00:20:38.960 --> 00:20:43.420
My soul that supposedly caused the tragedy.

00:20:50.560 --> 00:20:52.060
It's been 20,000 years.

00:20:58.480 --> 00:21:00.110
Okay, let's go.

00:21:10.790 --> 00:21:14.410
Thank you for coming out all this way.

00:21:16.620 --> 00:21:17.330
Moid.

00:21:19.250 --> 00:21:20.800
The payment, please.

00:21:27.720 --> 00:21:28.470
This.

00:21:31.430 --> 00:21:32.470
What is it?

00:21:41.520 --> 00:21:42.320
Impossible!

